        <head>LOCAL GOVERNMENT ON ITS TRIAL</head>
        <p>LOCAL GOVERNMENT ON ITS TRIAL</p>
        <p>The annual meeting of the Association of Municipal Corporation. was held at the London Guildhall on Wednesday. The Lord Mayor of London mid he thought local self-government was upon ite trial, for it might be purchased at too high a price. He suggested that thought should be given to the problems of hove to wenne greater economy, how far they were warranted in,pursuing municipal trading, and how to reduce the huge total of local I.ns. LINSICED COMPO CND is • good Coegh Muter. Eileen sad Economical. Of Chemists only. —Adrt</p>
