        <p>1111, NI, 1111,1 CS. . with • epray of flowers or an ornartient, placed slightly The most popular straw bids fair to be Tegal, t, the left while at the hack a similar device is winch unfortunately in rather expensive, hut there are employed but placed rather to the right. Some of the some excellent fine straw, not at all unlike it in flower hats again are tipped forward over the face, appearance. and costing about half as much. Some and the hark crinkled elaborately into folds, giving of the new colours are almost dazzling in their rather the effect of a basket of flowers half overturned. brightneea. accustomed as we have been loran long to Above a very pretty fare three and similar morlele the pnntrl ahadva, and the llaieler colours elwave in will he charming, but an unlimited latitude of choice vogue during the winter. Sapphire blue, a far in given that includes • number of styles far less lovelier shade than the Royal, yet quite as vivid, ins eugge, ted. great favourite, fuchsia red and several beautiful 4 shades of rose. A handsome picture hat in the afore- Slit ELTIES Col ,1,1111 INF tl:.</p>
