        <p>FIXING THE NEW ROLLER. WER ;111'o; si x Toxs. The Ship Canal Co.'s engineers have made a very expeditious repair to the Latchford Swing Bridge this week. It was announced to be closed to the public. from Monday last till Sunday, but the new roller was got into position by Thursday, and on the evening of the same day the bridge was swung back across the waterway, to the great delight of the hundreds of suburban residents who had been so greatly inconvenienced by the three-quarter mile journey over the Cantilever Bridge.</p>
