      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-03-25_WidnesExaminer_art0110" n="art0110">
        <head>AN ELECTRIC FIRE ESCAPE.</head>
        <p>AN ELECTRIC FIRE ESCAPE.</p>
        <p>The Lendon Ce linty Ccuncil has just Lad delivered at their headqu-ar'ers at Southwark • new type of Fire Escape, electrically driven, this being the first in use in this country. During the experiments lately cal red cut it preyed superior to the preset I type of mechanically driven machine. One cf tie strrngett Fonts in its favcnr being the rapidity with which a start is otta.ned, a speed of thirty miles an hour can be reached practically at the Vert.</p>
