        <p>-..—..... . ...-...... The finences of the Chester Pageant last July have now been settled. There is a balance of over £5OO, and it has been decided to give £4OO to the permanent funds of the Chester Infirmary and .ClOO to the Cheshire County Nursing Anociation. Some of the properties of the Pageant still remain mmold, and any- thing realised will also be distributed tetween the charities. In refunding £2,000 which wee subscribed to guaranis° the pageant, hut which it was not found neeeaeary to one, the 'executive Committee ask the sob• scribers to give the money to either or both of the charities.</p>
