        <p>Culcheth.</p>
        <p>INDENENDENT Muriiooisr.—&amp; We meeting and imolai promoted by the .dolt bible clessee in concoction with this place was held in the schoolroom on Saturday evening last. After tea same', Ac., were indulged in, eery etjoyable evening being spent.</p>
