        <p>_ ' The annual installation ceremony in Coonection with the St. Elphin Lodge of Freemasons. No. 3,287, tokrk place at the Lion Hotel, Warrington, on Tuesday, .wh n Bro. W. H. Owen was installed W.M. There nsA, a large attendance of local and provincial bre i, ren. The new W.M. invested his officers ~ In follor :—Bros. ..T. W. Bowen, S.W.; T. Stringer, J.W. ; en. J. H. G. Hollingworth, chaplain; W. Hodgkin, treasurer. ;T. S. Steel, secretary; J. H. Heywo S.D, :J. T. Barton, J.D. ;J. Finlayson, 1.0.; J. Parkin n. organist; I. Broady, S.S.• F. Garside, G. Newb e and W. Barton, A.S. •F. J. Dell, tiler ; A. F. G. P,tter. CR.; T. Hill, 'D.C. The retiring W.M., Br . Waldron, was presented with a handsome P.M.'s je 1.</p>
